changes since version 0.12 (beta)

v0.13

1.  Fixed a bug causing incorrect listing of languages.

2.  Changed the way flags are handled.  Now it is possible to
set/unset/preset individual flag combinations.

v0.14

3.  Added <AmigaKey> Hotkeys to menu items.

4.  Added ActivateWindow()s to windows as they open.

v015

5. TrUserEd no longer just fails if the system path defined in the
Tooltypes list is incorrect.  Now TrUserEd will prompt for the correct path
to locate NewUsers.BBS



